  titleEn: System log
  titlePt: Registro do sistema
  bodyEn: '[23:58] Terminal 07 powered on.

    [23:58] Operator badge: ACCEPTED.

    [23:59]
    Camera grid: 9/12 online. 3 cameras not responding.

    [00:00] Subject located:
    PADDED CELL. Vital signs: stable. Name on file: HELENA.

    [00:01] Door 07
    (operator room): LOCKED by remote command.

    [00:01] Remote command origin:
    UNKNOWN.

    [00:02] Note to the operator: do not try the door.'
  bodyPt: "[23:58] Terminal 07 ligado.\n[23:58] Crach\xE1 do operador: ACEITO.\n[23:59]
    Rede de c\xE2meras: 9/12 online. 3 c\xE2meras sem resposta.\n[00:00] Pessoa localizada:
    CELA ACOLCHOADA. Sinais vitais: est\xE1veis. Nome na ficha: HELENA.\n[00:01]
    Porta 07 (sala do operador): TRANCADA por comando remoto.\n[00:01] Origem do
    comando: DESCONHECIDA.\n[00:02] Aviso ao operador: n\xE3o tente a porta."
